  "text": "The TPA is pioneering the first parametric cyclone insurance solution in Bangladesh, aligning with the InsuResilience Vision 2025. It features a robust financing commitment from BMZ and risk capacity from IDF, an open modelling ecosystem for risk analytics, and synergy with UNDP’s Financial Resilience in Agriculture initiative. The program aims to close the protection gap in Bangladesh, where insurance penetration is currently low.",
